# Ship finished work only — see .cursor/rules/ship-finished-work.mdc and AGENTS.md

When generating or modifying code, you MUST gate-check and fix until PASS before sending the response.

## Gate workflow

```bash
python3 ~/.cursor/cursor_gate_fastest.py --file <path> --region us-west-2
python3 ~/.cursor/cursor_gate.py --file <path> --iterations 3
```

If either fails: fix every failed gate, re-run both. **No iteration cap.** Repeat until both return `"status": "PASS"`.

Only valid stop: **BLOCKED** — name the exact blocker and one specific ask.

## Forbidden

- Stopping after N attempts with failing gates
- Delivering code with known unfixed gate failures
- Failure summaries instead of fixes
